{
  "id": "1151",
  "title": "Things Never End Well for Swindlers",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-12-26",
  "synopsis": "Learn about the character for “to cheat”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1151/83a68579c277e029124c3efd7e8d2de7d786c3ec.mp3?1605623838",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "为什么骗子没有好下场？\n\n    为什么骗子没有好下场呢？因为骗子的“骗”是“马“和“扁”放在一起的，所以骗子骗人被发现以后，“马上”会被人“打扁”。",
    "traditional": "為什麼騙子沒有好下場？\n\n    為什麼騙子沒有好下場呢？因為騙子的“騙”是“馬“和“扁”放在一起的，所以騙子騙人被發現以後，“馬上”會被人“打扁”。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Why Do Things Never End Well for Swindlers?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "为什么骗子没有好下场呢？",
      "traditional": "為什麼騙子沒有好下場呢？",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me piàn zi méi yǒu hǎo xià chang ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "因为骗子的“骗”是“马“和“扁”放在一起的，",
      "traditional": "因為騙子的“騙”是“馬“和“扁”放在一起的，",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi piàn zi de piàn shì mǎ hé biǎn fàng zài yì qǐ de",
      "english": "Why do things never end well for swindlers?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "所以骗子骗人被发现以后，“马上”会被人“打扁”。",
      "traditional": "所以騙子騙人被發現以後，“馬上”會被人“打扁”。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ piàn zi piàn rén bèi fā xiàn yǐ hòu mǎ shàng huì bèi rén dǎ biǎn",
      "english": "Because the Chinese word for “to cheat” is the character for “horse” combined with the character for “to beat up”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So when swindlers cheat people and are caught, they’ll “immediately” get “beaten up”."
    }
  ],
